      "blocks": {
        "q_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How fast will I see a difference?",
            "answer": "<p>Every child is different. Many parents notice settled tummies and better appetites within 1–2 weeks of daily use.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does it taste like? Will my picky kid take it?",
            "answer": "<p>It has a natural raspberry flavour and a bitter blocker to soften the herbal taste. Mixed into orange juice or a berry smoothie, most kids drink it without a fuss. Starting with half a dropper helps too.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I measure the dose?",
            "answer": "<p>Shake well, then fill the dropper to the 1 mL line. That’s one serving.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does one bottle last?",
            "answer": "<p>One 1 oz (30 mL) bottle holds about 30 servings at 1 mL a day. That covers a full 2–3 week routine with some to spare.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe for my 3-year-old? What about side effects?",
            "answer": "<p>ParaPatrol is made and dosed for kids 3 and up, and is not for children under 3. Stop use and talk to your doctor if your child has vomiting, diarrhea, stomach pain, or any unusual reaction. See the <a href=\"#safety\">safety section</a> for the full list.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use it with other supplements or medication?",
            "answer": "<p>If your child takes medication or has a health condition, talk to your pediatrician before use. Bring the bottle along so they can see the full ingredient list.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it contain alcohol, sugar, or nuts?",
            "answer": "<p>No alcohol and no sugar. It is also gluten-free. It does contain tree nut (black walnut), so it is not for kids with a tree nut allergy.</p>"
          }
        },
